\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2000&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tar_Hurara\" title=\"Tar Hurara\">Tar Hurara</a>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Priapurl\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Priapurl\">Inhabitants of  Priapurl</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Priapurl\" title=\"Category:Locations in Priapurl\">Locations in  Priapurl</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Priapurl\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Priapurl\">Organizations in  Priapurl</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Priapurl</b> (<small><span style=\"font-variant: small-caps;\">pronounced</span>:&#160;/<a href=\"/wiki/P_as_in_%22paladin%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"P as in &quot;paladin&quot;\">p</a><a href=\"/wiki/R_as_in_%22ranger%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"R as in &quot;ranger&quot;\">r</a><a href=\"/wiki/Eye_as_in_%22eye%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Eye as in &quot;eye&quot;\">aɪ</a><a href=\"/wiki/A_as_in_%22bard%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A as in &quot;bard&quot;\">ɑː</a>ˈ<a href=\"/wiki/P_as_in_%22paladin%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"P as in &quot;paladin&quot;\">p</a><a href=\"/wiki/Er_as_in_%22nerd%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Er as in &quot;nerd&quot;\">ɜːr</a><a href=\"/wiki/L_as_in_%22law%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"L as in &quot;law&quot;\">l</a>/&#160;<i>pry-ah-PURL</i><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS1e-CR-p70_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS1e-CR-p70-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></small>) was a small town located on the <a href=\"/wiki/Trader%27s_Road\" title=\"Trader's Road\">Trader's Road</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Notable_Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Priapurl?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a>, the ruler of Priapurl was <a href=\"/wiki/Tar_Hurara\" title=\"Tar Hurara\">Tar Hurara</a>, who had descended from bandits but was often away from the town spending her time in the court of <a href=\"/wiki/Cormyr\" title=\"Cormyr\">Cormyr</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Priapurl?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the <a href=\"/wiki/1365_DR\" title=\"1365 DR\">Year of the Sword, 1365 DR</a>, Priapurl became besieged by a one-<a href=\"/wiki/Orc\" title=\"Orc\">orc</a> army <a href=\"/wiki/Slogg_Ogrum\" title=\"Slogg Ogrum\">Slogg Ogrum</a>. Slogg by his lonesome managed to almost bring the town to its knees if not for the <a href=\"/wiki/Mindulgulph_Mercenary_Company\" title=\"Mindulgulph Mercenary Company\">Mindulgulph Mercenary Company</a>, who eventually slew the threat. Disturbingly enough, no-one even uncovered the reason for the orc's attack. His impressive stash of powerful weapons was the only thing recovered from the siege, including the powerful <a href=\"/wiki/Crossbow\" title=\"Crossbow\">crossbow</a> – <i><a href=\"/wiki/Ogrum%27s_Siegebow\" title=\"Ogrum's Siegebow\">Ogrum's Siegebow</a></i>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-nwn2_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-nwn2-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Priapurl?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dt>Inns and Taverns</dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Dark Arch Inn (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGFya19BcmNoX0lubj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Dark Arch Inn</span><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS1E-p61_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS1E-p61-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Cyric%27s_Bane\" title=\"Lord Cyric's Bane\">Lord Cyric's Bane</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Priapurl?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Mindulgulph_Mercenary_Company\" title=\"Mindulgulph Mercenary Company\">Mindulgulph Mercenary Company</a> was a mercenary company of <a href=\"/wiki/Monstrous_humanoid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monstrous humanoid\">monstrous humanoids</a> and other monsters who maintained <a href=\"/wiki/Mindulgulph_Castle\" title=\"Mindulgulph Castle\">Mindulgulph Castle</a> overlooking the town in the hills to the south.<sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS1E-p61_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS1E-p61-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Inhabitants\">Notable Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Priapurl?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gayrlana\" title=\"Gayrlana\">Gayrlana</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tar_Hurara\" title=\"Tar Hurara\">Tar Hurara</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Zo_(bartender)\" title=\"Zo (bartender)\">Zo</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Priapurl?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Priapurl?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Novels</dt>\